    "created_at": "2022-12-02T07:05:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-12-02T07:29:44Z",
    "body": ">  Firefox does this for both xml and xmlns.\r\n\r\nThanks!\r\n\r\nSo the change will be:\r\n* Add `xml` and `xmlns` special handling to the Element section of https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#locate-a-namespace\r\n* Change the return value of `createNSResolver()` to `Node`\r\n\r\nWebKit people, do you have an objection?  WebKit can remove `NativeXPathNSResolver` if we proceed this.\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
